。渊闻之叹息曰：‘公绪早夭，同盟所哀。闻其子志行明辩，而被暗昧之谤；望诸夫子烈然高断，而各怀迟疑，非所望也。’秀卒见明，无复瑕玷，终为显士；渊之力也。”","attribution":"《会稽典录》","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":243,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4bb4ccb93c53bcb6a59d","start":0,"end":164},{"id":"santizhu-q-53a3f3a505426943733a","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-25a289c0c24062b2e434","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，海贼破海盐，杀司盐校尉骆秀","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
